= 0.0161) difference in the center between groups 1 and 3 (
Fig. 4B
) was observed. In contrast, the percentage of CD86 expressing tumor cells remained rather constant in all layers across the three stages, ranging between 91.1% and 98.9% expressing tumor cells (
